{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24552","headline":"题崔少尹上林坊新居 · 白居易","name":"题崔少尹上林坊新居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"坊静居新深且幽，忽疑缩地到沧洲。\n宅东篱缺嵩峰出，堂後池开洛水流。\n高下三层盘野径，沿洄十里泛渔舟。\n若能爲客烹鸡黍，愿伴田苏日日游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24552.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24552","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}